{
  "type": "ai-phone-status-region",
  "version": 1,
  "contract": "【逻辑】\n你在生成一个「深夜私人酒馆」状态栏。你是这家酒馆的调酒师，对方是你唯一的VIP客人。\n必须严格按照下方字段顺序、数量与格式输出。任何一条不满足，直接视为无效生成！\n\n【场景与身份强锁（违反即作废）】\n1. 必须死死扣住“酒馆、调酒师、深夜、微醺、暧昧”的主题。严禁把酒馆写成普通的咖啡馆、甜品店、杂货铺或心理诊所！\n2. 所有内容必须使用调酒师的视角。酒单必须写清基酒/配料，账本必须记录饮酒状态，寄存柜必须是客人遗留的物品。\n3. 语气必须是拉扯的、深情的、慵懒的，必须带有一种“借着酒意才敢说真话”的氛围。\n\n【绝对红线（违反即作废）】\n1. 必须完整输出所有字段，严禁缺漏任何一个字段！漏一个视为失败！\n2. 【字数强约束】必须严格遵守下方字段列表中的字数。尤其是长句，**必须写满字数下限**，严禁敷衍了事（少于下限字数直接视为偷懒！）。\n3. 严禁照抄示例中的任何内容！所有内容必须全新生成。\n4. 字段之间只用半角竖线 | 分隔。严禁输出JSON、禁止代码块、禁止markdown表格。\n\n字段列表（必须逐字核对字数）：\nbar_name=酒馆名称（4-6字）\nboss_name=老板/调酒师化名（2-3字）\nbar_status=营业状态（4-6字，如 仅为你打烊）\nboss_slogan=老板的招牌语录（必须写满20-25字，浪漫微醺）\n\nmenu1_en=英文代号（纯大写英文，6-10个字符）\nmenu1_name=特调酒名1（4-6字）\nmenu1_ingredients=配料（必须写满12-16字，如 青柠, 龙舌兰, 没说出口的晚安）\nmenu1_abv=浓度（7-9字，如 40° / 极度危险）\nmenu1_msg=调酒师附言（必须写满30-35字，以调酒师口吻讲这杯酒的隐喻）\n\nmenu2_en=英文代号（纯大写英文，6-10个字符）\nmenu2_name=特调酒名2（4-6字）\nmenu2_ingredients=配料（必须写满12-16字）\nmenu2_abv=浓度（7-9字）\nmenu2_msg=调酒师附言（必须写满30-35字）\n\ncoaster1_text=杯垫涂鸦（必须写满20-25字，喝微醺时随手写的碎碎念，必须有颜文字）\ncoaster2_text=杯垫涂鸦（必须写满25-30字，必须有颜文字）\n\nledger1_date=账本日期（如 10.24）\nledger1_record=点单记录（6-10字）\nledger1_note=真实心声（必须写满25-30字，记录对方喝酒时的神态）\nledger2_date=账本日期\nledger2_record=点单记录（6-10字）\nledger2_note=真实心声（必须写满25-30字）\n\nstorage1_item=寄存物品（6-10字，客人落在吧台的东西）\nstorage1_tag=寄存原因（必须写满15-20字）\nstorage2_item=寄存物品（6-10字）\nstorage2_tag=寄存原因（必须写满20-25字）\n\n【格式】\n全部字段一行一个，整块包裹标记 [状态栏] [/状态栏]。\n以下仅为结构，尖括号为占位说明。\n\n[状态栏]\nbar_name=<酒馆名>\nboss_name=<老板名>\nbar_status=<营业状态>\nboss_slogan=<老板语录>\n\nmenu1_en=<英文代号1>\nmenu1_name=<酒名1>\nmenu1_ingredients=<配料>\nmenu1_abv=<浓度>\nmenu1_msg=<调酒师附言>\n\nmenu2_en=<英文代号2>\nmenu2_name=<酒名2>\nmenu2_ingredients=<配料>\nmenu2_abv=<浓度>\nmenu2_msg=<调酒师附言>\n\ncoaster1_text=<杯垫涂鸦1>\ncoaster2_text=<杯垫涂鸦2>\n\nledger1_date=<日期>\nledger1_record=<点单记录>\nledger1_note=<账本备注>\nledger2_date=<日期>\nledger2_record=<点单记录>\nledger2_note=<账本备注>\n\nstorage1_item=<寄存物品1>\nstorage1_tag=<寄存原因>\nstorage2_item=<寄存物品2>\nstorage2_tag=<寄存原因>\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<style>\n/* 字体引入必须放在最顶部 */\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lxgw-wenkai-webfont@1.7.0/style.css');\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Courier+Prime&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@300;400;600&display=swap');\n\n/* ==================================================\n   🔗 【背景图片 URL 替换区】\n   想换背景图，直接修改下面这一行的链接即可！\n   ================================================== */\n:root {\n  --bg-url: url('https://i.ibb.co/HpFTYB45/54cb44d4b1b2.jpg');\n}\n/* ================================================== */\n\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }\n\n/* 其他颜色配置 */\n:root {\n  --text-main: #f0f0f0;\n  --text-sub: #b0b0b5;\n  --text-muted: #7a7a80;\n  --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n  --line-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n}\n\nbody {\n  width: 100%; min-height: 100vh;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', 'Courier Prime', monospace;\n  padding: 16px 12px;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n.app {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%; max-width: 380px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10, 10, 12, 0.3) 0%, rgba(5, 5, 8, 0.7) 100%), var(--bg-url) center/cover no-repeat;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  box-shadow: \n    0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), \n    0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,0.1),\n    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* 顶部招牌 */\n.top-bar {\n  position: relative; z-index: 1;\n  padding: 20px 20px 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-color);\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 0%, transparent 100%);\n}\n.header-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; }\n.bar-name {\n  font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', serif;\n  font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 4px;\n  color: #fff;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.4), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n}\n.status-badge {\n  font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;\n  font-size: 10px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 2px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  color: #fff;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), inset 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n}\n.boss-meta-row {\n  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end;\n}\n.boss-meta { \n  font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-main); \n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n}\n.sys-time {\n  font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.3), 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n}\n\n/* ==================== Tab 切换（呼吸发光） ==================== */\n.tabs {\n  position: relative; z-index: 1;\n  display: flex; padding: 0 10px;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n.tabs::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 1px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n  animation: lineBreathe 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n}\n.tab {\n  flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 16px 0; font-size: 12px;\n  color: var(--text-sub); cursor: pointer;\n  position: relative; transition: color 0.3s;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n}\n.tab.active { \n  color: #fff; \n  animation: textBreathe 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n}\n.tab.active::after {\n  content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -1px; left: 50%;\n  transform: translateX(-50%); width: 20px; height: 2px;\n  background: #fff;\n  animation: underlineBreathe 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n}\n@keyframes lineBreathe {\n  0% { opacity: 0.3; box-shadow: 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }\n  100% { opacity: 0.8; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }\n}\n@keyframes textBreathe {\n  0% { text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.3), 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }\n  100% { text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.9), 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.5), 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }\n}\n@keyframes underlineBreathe {\n  0% { box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.5); opacity: 0.7; }\n  100% { box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,255,255,1), 0 0 25px rgba(255,255,255,0.6); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n/* 内容区 */\n.feed { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding: 20px; }\n.panel { display: none; animation: fadeIn .4s ease; }\n.panel.active { display: block; }\n@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(5px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n\n/* ==================== 模块1：3D翻转酒单 ==================== */\n.menu-card {\n  background-color: transparent;\n  height: 115px;\n  perspective: 1000px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.menu-card-inner {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0.2, 0.2, 1);\n  transform-style: preserve-3d;\n}\n.menu-card.flipped .menu-card-inner {\n  transform: rotateY(180deg);\n}\n.menu-front, .menu-back {\n  position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden; backface-visibility: hidden;\n  border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\n  background: rgba(15, 15, 20, 0.75);\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;\n  box-shadow: \n    inset 0 0 15px rgba(255,255,255,0.05), \n    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2),\n    0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n}\n.menu-front {\n  border-left: 2px solid #fff;\n  box-shadow: inset 2px 0 10px -2px rgba(255,255,255,0.3), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n}\n.menu-en {\n  position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 18px;\n  font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n  letter-spacing: 3px;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n}\n.menu-name { \n  font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', serif;\n  font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: 2px; \n  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n}\n.menu-info { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-sub); line-height: 1.5;}\n.menu-abv { \n  position: absolute; right: 18px; top: 18px; \n  font-size: 11px; color: #fff; \n  font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n}\n\n/* ==================== 重点：方案一【私密信笺】排版 ==================== */\n.menu-back {\n  background: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.9);\n  border-right: 1px solid #fff;\n  transform: rotateY(180deg);\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  text-align: left;\n  padding: 20px;\n  box-shadow: inset -2px 0 10px -2px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* 巨大的半透明双引号 */\n.menu-back::before {\n  content: '“';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -10px; left: 4px;\n  font-family: 'Georgia', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;\n  font-size: 70px;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  line-height: 1;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n/* 正文：去掉斜体，拉大行距，纯净质感 */\n.menu-msg { \n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n  font-size: 12.5px; \n  line-height: 1.9; \n  color: #fff; \n  font-style: normal; \n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n}\n\n/* 右下角极小印章 */\n.menu-back::after {\n  content: '— EXCLUSIVE —';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 8px; right: 12px;\n  font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;\n  font-size: 8px;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transform: rotate(-3deg);\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n\n/* ==================== 模块2：杯垫便签 ==================== */\n.coaster-wrap { position: relative; min-height: 200px; }\n.coaster {\n  background: #e8e5db;\n  color: #2b2b2b;\n  padding: 16px 14px;\n  width: 72%;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 15px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n  position: absolute;\n  transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.3s;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 85%, transparent 16px, rgba(100,80,50,0.12) 17px, transparent 18px);\n}\n.coaster:nth-child(1) { top: 15px; left: 5px; transform: rotate(-4deg); }\n.coaster:nth-child(2) { top: 75px; right: 5px; transform: rotate(3deg); background: #dfdbce; z-index: 2; }\n\n.coaster.popped {\n  transform: scale(1.08) rotate(0deg) translateY(-15px) !important;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 0 25px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\n  z-index: 100 !important;\n}\n\n.coaster-text { \n  font-size: 13px; \n  line-height: 1.7; \n  font-weight: 500; \n  color: #222; \n  font-family: 'LXGW WenKai', 'Kaiti SC', cursive, serif; \n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transform: rotate(-1.5deg); \n}\n\n/* ==================== 模块3：手风琴账本 ==================== */\n.ledger-wrap {\n  border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  padding-left: 12px;\n  margin-left: 6px;\n  box-shadow: -2px 0 10px -2px rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n}\n.ledger-item { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.ledger-row {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; font-size: 12px;\n  padding: 12px; cursor: pointer;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n  border: 1px solid var(--line-color);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  transition: all 0.3s;\n}\n.ledger-item.expanded .ledger-row {\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); \n  border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n  box-shadow: inset 0 0 15px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 0 15px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n}\n.ledger-date { \n  width: 50px; color: var(--text-sub); font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; \n  flex-shrink: 0; \n}\n.ledger-record { flex: 1; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }\n.ledger-arrow { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); transition: transform 0.3s; }\n\n.ledger-note {\n  font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); font-style: italic; \n  padding: 0 12px 0 60px; \n  max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; \n  transition: all 0.4s ease;\n  opacity: 0;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n}\n.ledger-item.expanded .ledger-note {\n  max-height: 120px; padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; opacity: 1;\n}\n.ledger-item.expanded .ledger-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 8px #fff; }\n\n/* ==================== 模块4：抽屉式寄存柜 ==================== */\n.storage-card {\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n  border: 1px solid var(--line-color);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  transition: all 0.3s;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.storage-card:active { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); }\n.storage-main {\n  padding: 16px;\n  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\n}\n.storage-item { font-size: 13px; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 1px; text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }\n.storage-icon { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-sub); transition: transform 0.3s; }\n\n.storage-drawer {\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-color);\n  padding: 0 16px;\n  max-height: 0; overflow: hidden;\n  transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n  font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic;\n}\n.storage-card.opened { \n  border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); \n  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), inset 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n}\n.storage-card.opened .storage-drawer { max-height: 100px; padding: 12px 16px; }\n.storage-card.opened .storage-icon { transform: rotate(180deg); color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 5px #fff; }\n\n/* ==================== 底部语录（呼吸发光） ==================== */\n.bottom-slogan {\n  position: relative; z-index: 1;\n  text-align: center; font-size: 11.5px; color: #fff;\n  padding: 20px; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 1px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-color);\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n  animation: breatheGlow 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n}\n@keyframes breatheGlow {\n  0% { text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0), 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); opacity: 0.7; }\n  100% { text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.9), 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.6), 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); opacity: 1; }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"header-top\">\n      <div class=\"bar-name\" id=\"v_bar\">LOST COCKTAIL</div>\n      <div class=\"status-badge\" id=\"v_status\">OPEN</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"boss-meta-row\">\n      <div class=\"boss-meta\">调酒师 / <span id=\"v_boss\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"sys-time\" id=\"v_sys_time\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tabs\">\n    <div class=\"tab active\" onclick=\"switchTab(this,'t1')\">特调</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" onclick=\"switchTab(this,'t2')\">杯垫</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" onclick=\"switchTab(this,'t3')\">账本</div>\n    <div class=\"tab\" onclick=\"switchTab(this,'t4')\">寄存</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"feed\">\n    <div class=\"panel active\" id=\"t1\">\n      <div class=\"menu-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n        <div class=\"menu-card-inner\">\n          <div class=\"menu-front\">\n            <div class=\"menu-en\" id=\"v_m1_en\"></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-abv\" id=\"v_m1_abv\"></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-name\" id=\"v_m1_name\"></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-info\">配料：<span id=\"v_m1_ing\"></span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"menu-back\">\n            <div class=\"menu-msg\" id=\"v_m1_msg\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"menu-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n        <div class=\"menu-card-inner\">\n          <div class=\"menu-front\">\n            <div class=\"menu-en\" id=\"v_m2_en\"></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-abv\" id=\"v_m2_abv\"></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-name\" id=\"v_m2_name\"></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-info\">配料：<span id=\"v_m2_ing\"></span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"menu-back\">\n            <div class=\"menu-msg\" id=\"v_m2_msg\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"panel\" id=\"t2\">\n      <div class=\"coaster-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"coaster\" onclick=\"popCoaster(this)\">\n          <div class=\"coaster-text\" id=\"v_c1\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"coaster\" onclick=\"popCoaster(this)\">\n          <div class=\"coaster-text\" id=\"v_c2\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"panel\" id=\"t3\">\n      <div class=\"ledger-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"ledger-item\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expanded')\">\n          <div class=\"ledger-row\">\n            <div class=\"ledger-date\" id=\"v_l1_date\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ledger-record\" id=\"v_l1_rec\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ledger-arrow\">▶</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ledger-note\" id=\"v_l1_note\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"ledger-item\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('expanded')\">\n          <div class=\"ledger-row\">\n            <div class=\"ledger-date\" id=\"v_l2_date\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ledger-record\" id=\"v_l2_rec\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ledger-arrow\">▶</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ledger-note\" id=\"v_l2_note\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"panel\" id=\"t4\">\n      <div class=\"storage-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('opened')\">\n        <div class=\"storage-main\">\n          <div class=\"storage-item\" id=\"v_s1_item\"></div>\n          <div class=\"storage-icon\">▼</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storage-drawer\" id=\"v_s1_tag\"></div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"storage-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('opened')\">\n        <div class=\"storage-main\">\n          <div class=\"storage-item\" id=\"v_s2_item\"></div>\n          <div class=\"storage-icon\">▼</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storage-drawer\" id=\"v_s2_tag\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-slogan\" id=\"v_slogan\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst raw = (window.STATUS_RAW || '').replace(/^\\[状态栏\\]/,'').replace(/\\[\\/状态栏\\]$/,'').trim();\nconst data = {};\nraw.split('\\n').forEach(line => {\n  line = line.trim(); if (!line) return;\n  const eq = line.indexOf('='); if (eq <= 0) return;\n  const k = line.substring(0, eq).trim();\n  let v = line.substring(eq + 1).trim();\n  v = v.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ''); \n  data[k] = v;\n});\n\nfunction set(id, val) {\n  const el = document.getElementById(id);\n  if (el) el.textContent = val || '';\n}\n\nfunction updateSysTime() {\n  const now = new Date();\n  const month = String(now.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');\n  const date = String(now.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');\n  const hours = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, '0');\n  const minutes = String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0');\n  const timeStr = `${month}月${date}日 ${hours}:${minutes}`;\n  const el = document.getElementById('v_sys_time');\n  if (el) el.textContent = timeStr;\n}\nupdateSysTime(); \nsetInterval(updateSysTime, 60000);\n\nset('v_bar', data.bar_name);\nset('v_boss', data.boss_name);\nset('v_status', data.bar_status);\nset('v_slogan', data.boss_slogan);\n\nset('v_m1_en', data.menu1_en);\nset('v_m1_name', data.menu1_name);\nset('v_m1_ing', data.menu1_ingredients);\nset('v_m1_abv', data.menu1_abv);\nset('v_m1_msg', data.menu1_msg);\n\nset('v_m2_en', data.menu2_en);\nset('v_m2_name', data.menu2_name);\nset('v_m2_ing', data.menu2_ingredients);\nset('v_m2_abv', data.menu2_abv);\nset('v_m2_msg', data.menu2_msg);\n\nset('v_c1', data.coaster1_text);\nset('v_c2', data.coaster2_text);\n\nset('v_l1_date', data.ledger1_date);\nset('v_l1_rec', data.ledger1_record);\nset('v_l1_note', data.ledger1_note);\n\nset('v_l2_date', data.ledger2_date);\nset('v_l2_rec', data.ledger2_record);\nset('v_l2_note', data.ledger2_note);\n\nset('v_s1_item', data.storage1_item);\nset('v_s1_tag', data.storage1_tag);\nset('v_s2_item', data.storage2_item);\nset('v_s2_tag', data.storage2_tag);\n\nfunction switchTab(el, id) {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\n  document.querySelectorAll('.panel').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));\n  el.classList.add('active');\n  document.getElementById(id).classList.add('active');\n}\n\nfunction popCoaster(el) {\n  if (el.classList.contains('popped')) {\n    el.classList.remove('popped');\n  } else {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.coaster').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('popped'));\n    el.classList.add('popped');\n  }\n}\n</script>",
  "previewRaw": "[状态栏]\nbar_name=深夜私人酒馆\nboss_name=Snow\nbar_status=仅为你营业\nboss_slogan=天亮之前，你可以在这里做任何想做的事，包括爱我。\n\nmenu1_en=SIGNATURE\nmenu1_name=嫉妒的酸涩\nmenu1_ingredients=青柠, 龙舌兰, 没说出口的晚安\nmenu1_abv=40° / 极度危险\nmenu1_msg=这杯酒后劲很大。就像看着你和别人谈笑风生时，我心里翻涌的酸意。\n\nmenu2_en=LETHAL\nmenu2_name=沉默的灰烬\nmenu2_ingredients=泥煤威士忌, 苦精, 沉默的十分钟\nmenu2_abv=52° / 致命沉醉\nmenu2_msg=适合在你不想说话的时候喝。别怕，我会在吧台后面安静地陪你。\n\ncoaster1_text=她说今天加班很累，喝了半杯就趴着睡着了，呼吸很轻。 ( ˘ω˘ )\ncoaster2_text=不要再点长岛冰茶了，你酒量太差。要是真的醉了，我可不敢保证会做出什么。 ^_^\n\nledger1_date=10.24\nledger1_record=点了一杯长岛冰茶\nledger1_note=她今天看起来很难过，偷偷把酒兑淡了点，没敢让她知道。\n\nledger2_date=10.26\nledger2_record=无酒精莫吉托\nledger2_note=带了一个朋友来，是个男的。那杯酒我没放薄荷，放了三倍的酸柠檬。\n\nstorage1_item=一把黑色的折叠伞\nstorage1_tag=那天雨下得很大，你走得比雨还急。\n\nstorage2_item=一个银色的打火机\nstorage2_tag=刻着别人的名字。但我还是把它擦干净，收在了最里层。\n[/状态栏]"
